OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,5,     F100
OL,6,     GKate Molleson and American jazz
OL,7,     Gcritic Nate Chinen discuss the
OL,8,     GMiles Davis sound of the 1960s.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GKatie Derham is joined live in
OL,11,     Gstudio by baritone Thomas Hampson
OL,12,     Gand accordionist Ksenija
OL,13,     GSidorova. She also introduces
OL,14,     Glive music from the Linarol
OL,15,     GConsort.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Gfavourites.
